# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform,
# regardless of the cloning machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this,
# a Windows clone with Git's common core.autocrlf=true default checks out
# every text file (including all .go source) as CRLF, which gofmt then
# flags wholesale even though the committed blobs are plain LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
